<title>NETHERLANDS: Two Dutch soldiers die in Bosnia traffic accident.</title>
<headline>Two Dutch soldiers die in Bosnia traffic accident.</headline>
<dateline>THE HAGUE 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two Dutch soldiers serving with the Dutch contingent of the international Stabilisation Force (SFOR) in Bosnia died on Tuesday in a serious traffic accident, a Dutch defence ministry spokesman said.</p>
<p>Further details were being withheld pending notification of the soldiers' families, the spokesman said. REUTER KEL</p>
</text>
